Node/transport-level wins
- Keep-alive and connection reuse:
  - For axios/fetch, use an HTTP/1.1 keep-alive agent for both your DB/proxy and external API to remove handshake overhead.
- Fastify over Express (optional): typically 10–20% throughput gain; or slim your Express middleware to essentials only.
- JSON serialization: use MessagePack for internal service-to-service if payloads are sizable and frequent.
- Collocate services/Redis/DB in the same AZ/VPC; keep p95 intra-service RTTs <1–2ms.

Latency budget and quick wins
