What to do
- Use a single, long-lived HTTP client with keep-alive and tight timeouts.
- Cache aggressively in Redis (keyed by source_lang, target_lang, normalized text). For EN↔FR, set source_lang explicitly to skip auto-detect latency.
- Batch misses into a single provider call when translating multiple items.
- Deduplicate in-flight identical requests (single-flight) to prevent thundering herds.
- Implement retry with exponential backoff for 429/5xx and respect Retry-After.
