Reference implementation (Node 18, Express, Redis, DeepL)
- Single text endpoint with cache, keep-alive, retries, and in-flight dedupe.
- Batch endpoint that only sends misses to DeepL in one call.

Note: Replace DEEPL_API_KEY and wire your JWT middleware as needed.

